Inclusion Criteria:

1. Male or female healthy subjects aged 18 to 60 (including 18 and 60);
2. Weigh at least 50 kg (for male) and 45 kg (for female), respectively, and have a body mass index (BMI) ≥ 19 and ≤26 kg/m2. BMI = weight (kg)/\[height (m)\]2;
