* Women who are pregnant, lactating, or who are unwilling to use adequate contraception during the study period;
* Subjects or their legally authorized representatives who are unwilling to provide written informed consent;
* Subjects who, for any reason, are unable to comply with the study protocol or complete all required clinical follow-up visits;
* Subjects deemed by the investigator to be unsuitable for PFA treatment of AF.

Inclusion Criteria:

